{"version":1,"content":"<p>瑞士洛桑聯邦理工學院團隊開發出一種名為SPIFFI的新型熒光顯微成像方法，可從單次相機曝光中重建超分辨圖像，幫助研究人員觀察線粒體、微管等活細胞結構的快速變化。研究發表於《自然·方法》期刊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584428.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.655279+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:48:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"bfd0ca37ac7b4d4d0f91fd4e0a085ed3babb2e46322ec40bb7bcb556adcb569b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}